                <note rend="inline" type="source">867n.01/448: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Houghton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-12-03T16:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 3,
                                1925—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 3—3:42
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>370. My 366, November 30, 6 p.m.<anchor n="43" xml:id="d186-f1"/> Ratifications
                    exchanged this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Houghton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
